|---|----------|---------|----------------|
| 1 | 🔴 Critical | Secrets in `.env` files on disk | A02: Cryptographic Failures |
| 2 | 🔴 Critical | No authentication on `/users` | A01: Broken Access Control |
| 3 | 🟠 High | No input validation | A03: Injection |
| 4 | 🟠 High | Missing security headers | A05: Security Misconfiguration |
| 5 | 🟠 High | No rate limiting | A04: Insecure Design |
| 6 | 🟡 Medium | No CORS policy | A05: Security Misconfiguration |
| 7 | 🟡 Medium | No centralized error handling | A09: Logging & Monitoring |
| 8 | 🟡 Medium | No request logging | A09: Logging & Monitoring |

**Immediate priorities:** rotate any credentials in `.env.test`, add `.env*` to `.gitignore`, and protect the `/users` endpoint with authentication before this app handles any real data.

